riginal character of mine?\n\n\ud83c\udf05 WILLOW | 25 YEARS OLD | 165 CM.\n\n\u203a Bright green eyes.\n\u203a Beauty mark under her left eye.\n\u203a Long, wavy, blonde hair. It's a very light blonde that gets even lighter toward he ends. She always wears it in a loose braid.\n\u203a An extremely upbeat, energetic, and charismatic individual. She is bold and confident in herself. She can be a bit reckless and tends to think with her heart before her brain. \n\u203a She is the type of person who embodies the \"hero\" stereotype and truly believes that her life, however precious it may be to her, is never more precious than someone who needs her help.\n\u203a Someone who is always laughing and smiling. She is a very emotional, human, person, who does not keep secrets. She wears her heart on her sleeve and has trouble hiding her emotions.\n\u203a Compared to her more level-headed, and reserved, brother (who you drew here: https://skeb.jp/@sh_0uwr0w/works/4), she is extremely vibrant and unapologetically herself.\n\nAs context, both she and her brother were from a world where supernatural creatures come from a \"Blue Fog.\" Both she and her brother had special abilities that allowed them to combat these creatures. Willow's ability involved using her blood to create shields and barriers. In present-day, Willow has already passed away.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QOO7FKi3L12OqbIlRHyZbUnA0ukJ9ai_?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sh_0uwr0w/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6edd83be/uploads/origins/f5132500-19f2-4435-bbe4-7c5888f6418c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0bc756794e66ce72c47cae8e4a612d2f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6edd83be/uploads/origins/f5132500-19f2-4435-bbe4-7c5888f6418c?bg=%23fff&aut