nal character for me!\n\nappearance:\n- his right eye is considerably paler than his left eye, which is grey! \n- he has a beauty mark on the tip of his nose. \n- he also has two eyebrow piercings on the right side of his face, and a lip ring. \n- his face has a lot of scars. the scars include what look like little stitches (or \"X\"-es) at the corners of his lips.\n- his features are usually pretty hard to see clearly because his hair is so unruly haha. \n- his hair is black, messy, and covers most of his ear piercings. aside from the detailed/ornate ones he wears on his right ear, he wears two plain silver studs on his lobe on his left ear.\n- he wears sunglasses around a lot because his eyes are sensitive! \n- he is also always seen with a plain chain necklace around his neck.\n- i would love if you could add some blue forget-me-not tattoos on his arms! t\n\nprofile:\n- his age is unknown, but estimated to be about 24/25. \n- darker skin\n- 190 cm. he has an athletic build.\n- he dresses like a punk. a lot of ripped clothing, tattered/old clothes in general. his body is always too warm/hot and he works as a mechanic, so he likes to keep his clothes loose. \n- he has an easygoing/relaxed expression to his face that can come across as haughty and unapproachable sometimes, but he's actually pretty gentle-hearted. he doesn't remember any of his past, and he can't speak as a result of lingering trauma, but he tries his best to work hard and be useful!\n- because he cannot speak due to trauma, he uses his phone to type out messages for the most person. contrary to his tough appearance, he texts in a very cute way.\n- he is extremely naive because of how little he remembers of his past. in truth, he has a special ability that allows him to manipulate memories, and he inadvertently erased his own and is not aware of this. \n- he's from a world that is recovering from the apocalypse. cities have been dilapidated and torn down, and people are trying to rebuild, but it is s